<title>NEW ZEALAND: Westpac, NZ's Trust Bank to be WestpacTrust.</title>
<headline>Westpac, NZ's Trust Bank to be WestpacTrust.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The merged entity of Westpac Bank and Trust Bank will be known as WestpacTrust in New Zealand, chief executive Harry Price said on Friday.</p>
<p>The merged bank is the largest in New Zealand with 1.3 million customers and assets of NZ$26.4 billion.</p>
<p>It is owned by Westpac Banking Corp</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
